Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Princess Knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Fifty-First Episode\NKing Nylon
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.22,0:03:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The fortress to the South has\Nbeen occupied by the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.06,0:03:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All the soldiers in the\Nfortress have been killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.22,0:03:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,For the fortress to the\NNorth there is no more hope!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.46,0:03:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The fortress to the West is destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.94,0:03:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Union X is now close.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.78,0:03:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I had ordered that our army...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.86,0:03:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,...be divided into\Nfour equal parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.86,0:03:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,...and defend the borders from the\NEast, West, North, and South fortresses!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.94,0:03:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But there are no\Ntroops in any fortress!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.14,0:03:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell has the\NSilverland army gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.58,0:03:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Where has Duralumin gone\Nat this critical moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.42,0:03:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You are late,\NGrand Duke Duralumin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.74,0:03:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened\Nto the army of Silverland?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.38,0:04:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me, Grand Duke Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.22,0:04:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you gone mad, Prime Minister?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.18,0:04:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's Union X!\N- Duralumin, what does this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.42,0:04:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I've taken out the dignitaries!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.10,0:04:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,These you see are\Nthe brave warriors of Union X.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.02,0:04:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on,\NI will be the King of Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.42,0:04:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You all, instead, will die!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.62,0:04:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke, you are a traitor!\NIt's the end for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.74,0:04:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.74,0:04:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill those three nobodies!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.70,0:05:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire, come here!\N- Stop them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.62,0:05:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the room of skeletons
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.94,0:05:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.70,0:05:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke Duralumin\Nhas played a double game!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.82,0:05:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's kill the traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.58,0:05:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,All those who side\Nwith the King... will die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.02,0:05:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you lost your mind,\NGrand Duke Duralumin?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.50,0:05:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We must defeat the Grand Duke\Nand help their Majesties!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.42,0:06:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well... Very well...\NI obey...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.62,0:06:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is how those\Nwho act against me will be treated!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.90,0:06:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No one else will be able to enter\Nthis room,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.34,0:06:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,unless they tear down the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.62,0:06:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't leave anymore either?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.86,0:06:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Sapphire.\NOnly you can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.74,0:06:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen: a long time ago,\Nthere was a traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.62,0:06:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The King and his family,\Nback then too, locked themselves away...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.38,0:06:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,...in the room of skeletons\Nand the Prince...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.34,0:06:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,...managed to get out of here\Non his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.86,0:06:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He defeated the traitor\Nand liberated the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.06,0:06:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- What became of the King and the Queen?\N- They died in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.82,0:07:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,but the Prince rebuilt\Nthis land beautifully.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.54,0:07:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Sapphire, you too..
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.58,0:07:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't!\NI can't let you die! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.62,0:07:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- My dear mom and dad...\N- Poor Sapphire, my daughter..!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.14,0:07:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I will stay here with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.82,0:07:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, you must respect\Nyour father's will.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.86,0:07:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget\Nthat you will succeed me on the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.58,0:07:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an order and you must\Nrespect the King's orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.14,0:07:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you must flee from here and punish\Nthe traitor at any cost!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.02,0:07:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Sapphire: this secret passage\Nis so narrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.18,0:07:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,...that only a child\Ncan pass through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.38,0:07:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You will leave through this passage\Nand take this with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.38,0:07:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Legend says that the golden ball\Nrepresents the Royal Family,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.82,0:07:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the silver one Silverland,\Nand the copper one the people!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.98,0:07:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,These three spheres have the power\Nto defend our beloved kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.82,0:07:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now move, my son,\Nyou must go now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.14,0:07:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.22,0:07:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.66,0:07:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mother!\N- Don't hesitate, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.46,0:08:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Go and fight, Sapphire, for\Nthe salvation of the kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.26,0:08:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your destiny! Farewell,\NSapphire! Remember us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.82,0:08:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire!\N- Dad! Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.86,0:08:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I will return to save you,\Nso wait for me with faith!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.02,0:08:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Get moving! Knock\Ndown that rock! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.22,0:08:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,They all bear the mark of X.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.46,0:08:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We must finish the\Ncoronation ceremony of Plastic...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.06,0:09:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,...before X arrives. Gather\Nthe men in the courtyard!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.50,0:09:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.58,0:09:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, now Silverland is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.94,0:09:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a messenger\Nof the Union X army.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.82,0:09:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,X and his army are\Nless than 5 kilometers from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.86,0:09:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everything ready to receive them?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.10,0:09:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,5 kilometers from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.26,0:09:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Then there is no time\Nfor the ceremony!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.46,0:09:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, everyone! From this\Nmoment, Plastic, my son,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.54,0:09:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,is crowned King of Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.34,0:09:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And I, Duralumin,\Nwill assume the regency.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.94,0:09:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Does anyone have any objections?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.18,0:09:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ring the bell\Nto celebrate this event!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.90,0:10:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,One moment! I'll ring it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.90,0:10:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Because my son has become King!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.14,0:10:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon! You traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.06,0:10:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No! I have nothing to do with it! No! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.58,0:10:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough! Enough! Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.90,0:11:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the King now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.06,0:11:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I have become the King of Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.82,0:11:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Page, clean my face at once!\NQuick, you scoundrel! Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.90,0:11:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I want to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.54,0:11:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My back is stiff!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.82,0:11:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.90,0:11:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?\NAnswer King Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.94,0:11:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,King Nylon, it's over for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.50,0:11:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ho... Ho... How dare you\Nto your King...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.94,0:11:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Which King?\N- I... am the King!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.58,0:12:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you running?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.46,0:12:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,X is coming\Nwith his army!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.90,0:12:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.34,0:12:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- I was waiting for you, dear X!\N- Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.14,0:12:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Excellency!\NWelcome a thousand times!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.86,0:12:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you! You don't know how\Nhappy I am to see you, my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.42,0:12:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't wait for you to arrive!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.54,0:12:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me, please! Kill this\Nguy who is chasing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.82,0:13:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You finished him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.74,0:13:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, X:\Nthis land will never die!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.50,0:13:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as these three spheres exist,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.54,0:13:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You will not be able to destroy\Nthe kingdom of Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.46,0:13:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.90,0:13:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The mysterious knight?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.90,0:14:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, mom...\NI'll come back with Franz to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.70,0:14:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.74,0:14:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Opale!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.02,0:14:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And Sapphire? And Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.94,0:14:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz! Listen, Franz!\NThe King and Queen are in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.70,0:14:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz, why are you turning away?\NWhat did I say? What's happening to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.94,0:14:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know what's happening\Nin the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.46,0:14:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You went there because you are\Nin love with Sapphire, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.42,0:14:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire is closer to you than to me:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.50,0:14:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,that's why you know so well\Nwhat happens in the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.50,0:15:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell Sapphire that I don't want to\Nsee her again! You take care of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.34,0:15:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,In reality, I am nothing,\Nabsolutely nothing to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.54,0:15:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just a stupid stubborn fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.18,0:15:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.\NPlease, you protect Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.70,0:15:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- Opale, get out of the way!\N- Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.66,0:15:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But then it's you, Sapphire?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.86,0:15:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And to think I had\Nnever recognized you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.30,0:16:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We must free them! We must\Nfree your father and your mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.74,0:16:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They are no longer here.\NThey must have taken them...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.06,0:16:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,...and they must have locked them up in\Nsome other part of the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.58,0:17:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! They aren't even here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.82,0:17:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my dear mother and father!\NWhere are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.90,0:17:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Take heart, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.58,0:17:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay calm, Sapphire.\NWe will find them somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.78,0:17:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,X orders that anyone who finds\NPrincess Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.74,0:17:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,...must execute her immediately,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.10,0:17:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,on pain of their own life! These\Nare the orders of the X Union!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.26,0:17:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How are we going to get around the castle? It'll be full of soldiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.22,0:17:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to try, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.26,0:17:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember what Union X commands you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.78,0:17:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- Where should we look? - We'll scour every corner of this castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.06,0:18:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do you think we'll make it?\N- Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.38,0:18:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The trouble is, we don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.94,0:18:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's best if we split up, that way we can search better. What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.10,0:18:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- All right.\N- Now, listen to me:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.98,0:18:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,you search on one side and I'll search on the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.18,0:18:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So we are agreed,\Nwe'll meet back here in thirty minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.18,0:18:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.30,0:18:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings, Your Excellency!\NWhat do you think of my idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.82,0:18:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The news, by now, must have\Nreached every corner of the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.86,0:18:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the most remote!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.34,0:18:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire must have\Nfound out about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.38,0:19:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,...and perhaps, by now, she is\Nalready headed for the Northern pasture!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.14,0:19:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a trap, just as I suspected.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.06,0:19:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Baron Nylon,\Nyou are speaking too loudly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.54,0:19:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You called me "Baron"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.58,0:19:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Fool! I am the King,\Ndon't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.14,0:19:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you are still Baron Nylon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.58,0:19:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,X has decided this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.78,0:19:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,How strange... His Excellency X\Nhad promised to make me King!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.14,0:19:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I put on this crown!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.22,0:19:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellency, you promised\Nthat whoever received you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.74,0:19:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,...would be King!\NIsn't it true, Excellency?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.78,0:19:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I never keep promises!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.18,0:19:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean you\Nnever keep promises?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.10,0:19:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, exactly. Do you have\Nanything to say about that, Nylon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.10,0:20:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I will go. You go\Nin the opposite direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.70,0:20:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see that everything will be fine.\NWe will find your parents, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.54,0:20:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No! Away! Away! Go away!\NGet out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.58,0:20:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No! No! Leave me alone! Away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.66,0:20:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Away! Away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.54,0:20:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Away! Away! Forgive me, Duralumin!\NDo not hold a grudge against me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.66,0:20:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Please! I'll give this back to you!\NAnything you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.94,0:21:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon, I will not forget\Nyour betrayal!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.06,0:21:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No! No, forgive me! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.30,0:21:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting for the King and the Queen\Nin hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.94,0:21:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,but they haven't arrived yet.\NI have come to take them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.42,0:21:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, where are they now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.74,0:21:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The King and the Queen\Nare to be executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.14,0:21:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,...on Skeleton Island,\Nin the Western Sea, tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.18,0:21:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- Executed?!\N- They were sent to the coast.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.98,0:21:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,..with a private carriage,\Na few hours ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.74,0:21:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.18,0:21:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,"I am Sapphire.\NI'm going to the North pasture.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.62,0:21:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where my parents are"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.66,0:21:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad! Mom! I'm coming to free you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.02,0:22:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Didn't you know it was a trap?\N- Damn it, Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.58,0:22:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal, let's try to escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.94,0:22:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, tell me the truth! Where\Nare the King and the Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.66,0:22:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We took them to\NSkeleton Island...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.42,0:22:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,...and tonight they\Nwill be executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.78,0:22:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Executed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.58,0:23:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,God in heaven, please, protect\Nmy mother and my father!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.34,0:23:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom! Dad! Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.58,0:23:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun has already set.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.10,0:23:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.58,0:23:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are my parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.62,0:24:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I discovered the boat\Nthat was about to set sail...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.94,0:24:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,...and I thought of getting\Non to go and get them, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.82,0:24:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.10,0:24:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't cry, Sapphire.\NNow you have something to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.30,0:24:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother! Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.22,0:24:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Be strong, Sapphire. Now you have\Na great task to fulfill:
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.42,0:24:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,that of fighting to free\Nyour country from the oppressor!
